<title>USA: Typhoon Tina gathering strength off Philippines.</title>
<headline>Typhoon Tina gathering strength off Philippines.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Typhoon Tina was gathering strength east of the northern Philippines, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Monday.</p>
<p>Tina was expected to turn to the north, possibly threatening Japan within the next couple of days.</p>
</text>
